<title>UK: CITIC sets 200 million mark five-year bond.</title>
<headline>CITIC sets 200 million mark five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CHINA INTERNATIONAL TRUST AND INVESTMENT CORP (CITIC)</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    12.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    12.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+62 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BBB	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.30	SELL CONC  1.70	LIST FEE    0.50</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 122 BOBL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
